398
00:15:48,966 --> 00:15:50,179
data and storage.

399
00:15:50,179 --> 00:15:51,795
Where information lives,

400
00:15:51,795 --> 00:15:53,181
how to read it fast,

401
00:15:53,181 --> 00:15:54,624
and how vectors work.

